WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.458 --> 00:00:33.791
After dividing all beings into divine
and demoniac natures

2
00:00:33.791 --> 00:00:37.083
in the previous two verses,

3
00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:40.125
Lord Krishna now begins a detailed description

4
00:00:40.125 --> 00:00:43.583
of the demoniac nature in this seventh verse.

5
00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:46.500
He says that such people's thinking is

6
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.791
neither guided by scripture

7
00:00:48.791 --> 00:00:50.458
nor centred in truth,

8
00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:54.250
discipline, or purity.

9
00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:56.583
Lord Krishna also makes clear

10
00:00:56.583 --> 00:00:59.166
that the difference between divine
and demoniac

11
00:00:59.166 --> 00:01:02.125
nature lies not only in outer behaviour.

12
00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:04.875
It lies in how a person

13
00:01:04.875 --> 00:01:07.083
sees the world,

14
00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:09.500
what values they give importance to,

15
00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:13.166
and how they conduct themselves

16
00:01:13.166 --> 00:01:15.666
when they are unaccountable to wisdom.

17
00:01:20.375 --> 00:01:23.041
Having a demoniac nature does not mean

18
00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.250
that a person

19
00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.333
will have horns on their head

20
00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:29.125
or look terrifying.

21
00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:32.041
Their demoniac nature is revealed by their

22
00:01:32.041 --> 00:01:36.250
tendency to not care about right and wrong.

23
00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:39.916
In this verse Lord Krishna says clearly –

24
00:01:39.916 --> 00:01:43.041
‘Those of demoniac nature do not
know what should be done

25
00:01:43.041 --> 00:01:45.333
and what should not.’

26
00:01:45.333 --> 00:01:46.583
This is not because

27
00:01:46.583 --> 00:01:49.125
they lack the intelligence to understand,

28
00:01:49.125 --> 00:01:50.375
but because

29
00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:54.375
they either reject the guidance of scripture,

30
00:01:54.375 --> 00:01:58.125
or were never taught

31
00:01:58.125 --> 00:02:01.125
to respect scripture.

32
00:02:01.125 --> 00:02:04.125
Their life is not guided by higher values,

33
00:02:04.125 --> 00:02:07.125
but only by whatever seems

34
00:02:07.125 --> 00:02:10.250
convenient or appealing in the moment.

35
00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:13.333
They hold on to what pleases them

36
00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:15.000
and abandon

37
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.958
what demands discipline,

38
00:02:17.958 --> 00:02:19.333
without asking

39
00:02:19.333 --> 00:02:23.250
whether it is morally or spiritually right

40
00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:24.958
or not.

41
00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:26.250
It is just like

42
00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.708
a patient who throws away

43
00:02:27.708 --> 00:02:30.000
the doctor's prescription

44
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.916
and eats whatever they desire.

45
00:02:33.916 --> 00:02:36.250
Those with demoniac tendencies

46
00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:39.125
also reject that guidebook of life

47
00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:42.666
which is made to give direction
to the human journey -

48
00:02:42.666 --> 00:02:44.125
The scripture.

49
00:02:44.125 --> 00:02:48.166
Lord Krishna points to the
lack of three qualities –

50
00:02:48.166 --> 00:02:51.791
shaucha, achara, and satya,

51
00:02:51.791 --> 00:02:57.083
that is, purity, good conduct, and truth.

52
00:02:57.083 --> 00:02:59.500
These are not trivial matters.

53
00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:03.250
Purity reflects, at both the outer and inner

54
00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:06.041
level, cleanliness of purpose and

55
00:03:06.041 --> 00:03:09.583
discipline of body and mind.

56
00:03:09.583 --> 00:03:11.291
Good conduct means

57
00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:12.583
moving according to one's

58
00:03:12.583 --> 00:03:15.333
duties and roles,

59
00:03:15.333 --> 00:03:20.000
not merely chasing one's own desires.

60
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:23.666
And truth – truth is the foundation of dharma.

61
00:03:23.666 --> 00:03:25.166
Without truth, society

62
00:03:25.166 --> 00:03:30.083
becomes only a market of deceit.

63
00:03:30.083 --> 00:03:33.875
Yet if someone does not follow scripture today,

64
00:03:33.875 --> 00:03:36.958
but listens to their inner conscience

65
00:03:36.958 --> 00:03:39.166
and lives with humility

66
00:03:39.166 --> 00:03:40.708
and respect for others,

67
00:03:40.708 --> 00:03:44.166
then for them the path to liberation is not closed.

68
00:03:44.166 --> 00:03:47.000
But those who reject all forms

69
00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.166
of guidance and truth,

70
00:03:49.166 --> 00:03:51.083
take pride in falsehood,

71
00:03:51.083 --> 00:03:53.416
and oppose purity –

72
00:03:53.416 --> 00:03:54.625
for them Lord Krishna

73
00:03:54.625 --> 00:03:58.583
warns that the path they are on

74
00:03:58.583 --> 00:04:02.875
leads toward greater bondage.

75
00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:06.333
Ultimately, this verse is not meant to label

76
00:04:06.333 --> 00:04:07.916
some people as demoniac

77
00:04:07.916 --> 00:04:10.708
and blame them.

78
00:04:10.708 --> 00:04:13.583
It is a mirror for us too,

79
00:04:13.583 --> 00:04:16.958
through which we can see whether

80
00:04:16.958 --> 00:04:20.916
our own conduct is moving
toward darkness or not.

81
00:04:25.583 --> 00:04:27.916
There will be such moments in life,

82
00:04:27.916 --> 00:04:30.500
when you are not clear

83
00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.125
about what should be done,

84
00:04:32.125 --> 00:04:35.625
what is right and what should not be done.

85
00:04:35.625 --> 00:04:38.125
The line that lies between these two

86
00:04:38.125 --> 00:04:40.791
can feel very blurred.

87
00:04:40.791 --> 00:04:43.708
Do not ignore those moments.

88
00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:45.000
Do not only do

89
00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:48.541
what feels easy, or what everyone is doing.

90
00:04:48.541 --> 00:04:52.125
Pause, and turn inward.

91
00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:55.000
Those of demoniac nature do not know

92
00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.708
what should and should not be done.

93
00:04:57.708 --> 00:04:59.208
This is not because

94
00:04:59.208 --> 00:05:01.041
they have no intelligence, or

95
00:05:01.041 --> 00:05:05.166
that they lack intelligence, but because

96
00:05:05.166 --> 00:05:09.041
they stop listening.

97
00:05:09.041 --> 00:05:13.041
To Me, to their own conscience,

98
00:05:13.041 --> 00:05:17.000
and to their own wisdom.

99
00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.708
They live their life only by convenience

100
00:05:19.708 --> 00:05:22.875
and intense impulse.

101
00:05:22.875 --> 00:05:28.416
You do not need to be perfect, you only

102
00:05:28.416 --> 00:05:30.750
need to stay connected.

103
00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:34.666
When you come to Me, confused,

104
00:05:34.666 --> 00:05:38.125
reflect within on the basis of

105
00:05:38.125 --> 00:05:40.250
divine knowledge,

106
00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:42.833
ask sincerely,

107
00:05:42.833 --> 00:05:46.666
and I will give you clarity.

108
00:05:46.666 --> 00:05:49.750
Sometimes through intuition,

109
00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:53.666
sometimes through scripture, and sometimes

110
00:05:53.666 --> 00:05:57.291
through the peace in your heart.

111
00:05:57.291 --> 00:05:58.916
Walking the path of truth

112
00:05:58.916 --> 00:06:00.500
does not always feel easy.

113
00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:02.250
But

114
00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:05.833
this path always feels sacred.

115
00:06:05.833 --> 00:06:07.708
Like

116
00:06:07.708 --> 00:06:10.541
a calm strength within.

117
00:06:10.541 --> 00:06:14.875
And that is the sign that you
are in the right direction.

118
00:06:14.875 --> 00:06:20.875
So whenever you are in doubt, do not rush.

119
00:06:20.875 --> 00:06:22.041
Do not look away.

120
00:06:22.041 --> 00:06:25.916
Simply turn inward,

121
00:06:25.916 --> 00:06:27.625
and you will

122
00:06:27.625 --> 00:06:29.750
find Me there.

123
00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:32.541
Waiting to guide you.

124
00:06:32.541 --> 00:06:33.916
Waiting.

125
00:06:38.583 --> 00:06:42.375
In a family, we often focus on

126
00:06:42.375 --> 00:06:43.500
what to eat,

127
00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:44.458
where to study,

128
00:06:44.458 --> 00:06:47.833
or how to achieve success,

129
00:06:47.833 --> 00:06:52.041
but forget that right and wrong –

130
00:06:52.041 --> 00:06:54.083
talking about these two

131
00:06:54.083 --> 00:06:55.791
is equally important.

132
00:06:55.791 --> 00:06:58.625
Those of demoniac nature do not know

133
00:06:58.625 --> 00:07:01.333
what should be done and what should not.

134
00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:05.833
This is not because they are evil,

135
00:07:05.833 --> 00:07:08.666
but because

136
00:07:08.666 --> 00:07:12.125
they were never taught

137
00:07:12.125 --> 00:07:14.875
that they should care about this too.

138
00:07:14.875 --> 00:07:20.750
Do not assume that children or adults
already know everything.

139
00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.000
If you do not openly discuss

140
00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:26.875
integrity, discipline, and compassion,

141
00:07:26.875 --> 00:07:30.625
then the outside world will fill their minds.

142
00:07:30.625 --> 00:07:35.500
With confusion, with shortcuts,
and with self-interest.

143
00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:38.125
Begin with small things.

144
00:07:38.125 --> 00:07:42.041
Explain why truth is necessary,

145
00:07:42.041 --> 00:07:45.333
even when it sometimes feels difficult.

146
00:07:45.333 --> 00:07:48.000
Show how keeping one's word

147
00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.000
strengthens trust.

148
00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:54.083
Make not only your words, but

149
00:07:54.083 --> 00:07:58.125
your entire life a teaching.

150
00:07:58.125 --> 00:08:01.375
Teach through love, not fear.

151
00:08:01.375 --> 00:08:06.583
Guide with patience, not pressure.

152
00:08:06.583 --> 00:08:08.916
When right and wrong are

153
00:08:08.916 --> 00:08:12.458
passed on with warmth,

154
00:08:12.458 --> 00:08:16.791
then I quietly become a part
of every conversation,

155
00:08:16.791 --> 00:08:21.458
every choice, and every life.

156
00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:29.083
In professional life, opportunity and power

157
00:08:29.083 --> 00:08:31.083
come quickly,

158
00:08:31.083 --> 00:08:34.916
but the wisdom to use them rightly

159
00:08:34.916 --> 00:08:37.875
often comes later.

160
00:08:37.875 --> 00:08:39.041
This is why,

161
00:08:39.041 --> 00:08:42.000
when the chance comes before
you to bend rules,

162
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.208
take shortcuts,

163
00:08:43.208 --> 00:08:44.875
or work only

164
00:08:44.875 --> 00:08:47.708
for personal gain,

165
00:08:47.708 --> 00:08:50.500
temptation comes alongside it.

166
00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:54.541
But I have said, those of demoniac nature

167
00:08:54.541 --> 00:08:57.666
do not know, or do not care,

168
00:08:57.666 --> 00:09:01.791
what should be done and what should not.

169
00:09:01.791 --> 00:09:04.625
They only chase the result

170
00:09:04.625 --> 00:09:06.541
and ignore its

171
00:09:06.541 --> 00:09:08.375
harmful consequences.

172
00:09:08.375 --> 00:09:12.000
You must keep in mind –

173
00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:15.541
you are not here only to win.

174
00:09:15.541 --> 00:09:18.041
You are here to walk

175
00:09:18.041 --> 00:09:21.125
with dignity.

176
00:09:21.125 --> 00:09:23.333
Ask yourself.

177
00:09:23.333 --> 00:09:26.708
Merely because some action is permitted,

178
00:09:26.708 --> 00:09:30.583
does that action become aligned
with the right path?

179
00:09:30.583 --> 00:09:32.833
Remember –

180
00:09:32.833 --> 00:09:35.416
success without integrity does not last,

181
00:09:35.416 --> 00:09:40.041
and respect without truth is hollow.

182
00:09:40.041 --> 00:09:43.750
And this distinction, your heart

183
00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:49.000
recognises well from within.

184
00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.500
True strength is not

185
00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:54.500
that you can do whatever you want.

186
00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.458
True strength is

187
00:09:56.458 --> 00:10:00.625
that, even when you have the
opportunity, you choose what is right.

188
00:10:00.625 --> 00:10:02.166
When you

189
00:10:02.166 --> 00:10:07.125
make the voice of your inner
conscience your guide,

190
00:10:07.125 --> 00:10:11.583
then your job is not just an ordinary task,

191
00:10:11.583 --> 00:10:16.000
but becomes a service, becomes a legacy,

192
00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:21.125
and becomes a reflection of a higher purpose.

193
00:10:21.125 --> 00:10:25.000
This is the path of divine leadership.
